# Deserter's Disciple: "{T}: Another target creature you control with power 2 or less can't be blocked this turn." {1}{R} needs red
# (Mox Ruby and Mox Pearl pay exactly). In turn 1 it is summoning sick (CR 302.6), so the ability is refused. In
# turn 3 the targets are checked: the Disciple itself (not another), Bot2's 0/2 Ornithopter (not yours) and the 3/3 Hill Giant (power
# 3, one over the limit) are refused while the 2/2 Runeclaw Bear (exactly 2) is accepted. The tap is the whole cost. Bot2's Ornithopter
# may not block the Bear in turn 3 (Bot2 takes 2) but may in turn 5 ("this turn" has ended) and dies to the Bear.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Deserter's Disciple
Runeclaw Bear
Hill Giant
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Runeclaw Bear.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana = 
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Deserter's Disciple.Cast
? Bot1.Mana = 
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Battlefield.Deserter's Disciple.Activate(Ability: can't be blocked; Bot1.Battlefield.Runeclaw Bear)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
